%!PS
/r { 0 0 3 -1 roll 1 rectfill } def
/p { 1 1 rectfill } def
/b { { 1 } { 0 } ifelse r } def
newpath 10 20 moveto 30 40 lineto 5 60 70 80 90 1 curveto pathbbox 4 { r } repeat
newpath pathbbox 4 { r } repeat
newpath 1 1 moveto pathbbox 4 { r } repeat
newpath 50 50 10 0 90 arc pathbbox 4 { r } repeat
2 3 scale newpath 1 1 moveto 4 5 lineto pathbbox 4 { r } repeat
